# Optional contact form settings for a static GitHub Pages build.
# PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID should be the real public form ID from the dashboard.
# PUBLIC_CONTACT_PRIVACY_NOTICE should contain the approved public notice.
# PUBLIC_CONTACT_PRIVACY_APPROVED must be explicitly set to true only after review.
# Keep this file free of IDs, personal data and credentials.
# Put local values in ignored .env files, never in this example.
